This skill (`romance-sim`) is an open-source framework for interactive fictional
storytelling and creative roleplay. All characters, personas, memories,
dialogues, and generated illustrations produced with this skill are works of
fiction intended for consenting adult audiences. Any resemblance to actual
persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental. Users are
solely responsible for their custom persona configurations, interaction
boundaries, and compliance with applicable local laws and platform policies.
